Review this churn risk report and give action recommendations.

Date: {{ $json.scanDate }}
Total scanned: {{ $json.totalScanned }}
At risk: {{ $json.totalAtRisk }} ({{ $json.highRisk.length }} high, {{ $json.medRisk.length }} medium)
MRR at risk: {{ $json.atRisk[0]?.currency || 'USD' }}{{ $json.totalMrrAtRisk }}/month

High risk accounts:
{{ $json.highRisk.slice(0,8).map(c => `- ${c.customerName} (${c.plan}, MRR: ${c.currency}${c.mrr}) — score ${c.riskScore}: ${c.signals.join(', ')}`).join('\n') || 'none' }}

Medium risk:
{{ $json.medRisk.slice(0,5).map(c => `- ${c.customerName} — ${c.signals.join(', ')}`).join('\n') || 'none' }}

Give: (1) the 2-3 highest-priority interventions today, (2) a pattern observation across the at-risk cohort if one exists, (3) one systemic fix if the signals suggest a product or process problem.

